{
  "_readme": "ComfyUI API-format workflow. Flux.1-dev + LILO identity LoRA + PuLID-Flux face lock. Requires custom node pack: ComfyUI-PuLID-Flux (balazik) or its Enhanced fork. Nodes are patched by _meta.title from src/zozobra/image_gen.py.",
